    <string name="help_content">Welcome to Calculator Launcher.\n\n• Use the Basic tab for everyday calculations.\n• Open the Calculators tab for Tip, Unit, BMI, Mortgage, Loan, Compound Interest, and Currency tools.\n• Each tool uses the on-screen keypad — tap a field, then enter values.\n• Use dropdowns where available to pick options like years, units, or currencies.\n\nNeed more help? Check FAQs from the side menu.</string>

    <string name="faqs_content">Q: Why does my home screen look different?\nA: Some calculator launcher apps can change the default home app. You can switch back from your phone Settings → Apps → Default apps → Home app.\n\nQ: How do I clear a calculation?\nA: Tap C on the keypad, or Reset on Mortgage.\n\nQ: Can I add more currencies?\nA: Yes. Open Currency Converter and tap + Add Currency.\n\nQ: Is BMI medical advice?\nA: No. BMI is for general information only, not medical guidance.\n\nQ: Are exchange rates live?\nA: Rates shown are sample/offline rates for conversion preview.</string>

    <string name="privacy_content">Privacy Policy\n\nCalculator Launcher respects your privacy.\n\n• Calculations run on your device.\n• We do not require an account to use the calculators.\n• Optional ads may collect limited device data through ad partners.\n• You can request data deletion from partners according to their policies.\n\nFor questions, contact support via your app store listing.\n\nBy using this app you agree to this Privacy Policy.</string>
